# #   character is a slash INCLUDING the doubled form, and the classifier routes
# #   that form down the absolute branch. Its raw counterpart demands a dotted
# #   letter-TLD authority, so for a single-label host, a bracketed IPv6 literal or
# #   a bare address, the only reader is the stripped one. Four references pass
# #   silently, each planted alone with the baseline asserted empty in the same
# #   run, and controls in that run isolate the cause to BOTH ingredients.
# #   THE FIX IS ONE LINE AND THE REVIEWER MEASURED IT: relax the raw reader's
# #   authority shape, still raw. Real site clean in all three buckets, all four
